usage: serial_monitor.py [-h] --port PORT --family {vt12,vt13}
                         [--seconds SECONDS] [--query] [--keyframe]

Monitor an explicitly selected protocol CDC; optional VT12 status query. No
robot business writes. --keyframe sends VT13 request/cancel once; start USB
capture first. One process must own the protocol serial port.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --port PORT
  --family {vt12,vt13}
  --seconds SECONDS
  --query
  --keyframe
